@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
' Exam submission (Module 6): Views/ExamWindow (SubmitButton: "N unanswered question(s). Submit anyway?"; timer at 0 -> automatic
' submit; DoSubmit; Offline -> automatic submit retries every 10 s, a manual one asks to press Submit again; ShowReceipt; Close ->
' Window_Closing -> LockdownCoordinator.Dispose). ViewModels/ExamSessionViewModel.SubmitAsync -> SubmitCoreAsync (queues every
' unsent edit, FlushOfflineAsync; Offline when a save is still undelivered, D-19; a save refused after the deadline is Rejected and
' dropped, so it does not block the submit), ApiClient.SubmitExamAsync, Core/Submission/ReceiptHasher (local hash vs server hash).
' ExamsController.Submit (POST /api/exams/sessions/{sid}/submit: SeatGuard.DesktopRequired D-45, 404 foreign/missing session,
' 400 when not InProgress), SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync (reads Answers, sets Status and ReceiptSha256, GradingService.StageAsync
' only if AiEvaluationEnabled, PlagiarismService.DetectAsync only if !IsMock, AuditService.Add SESSION_SUBMITTED with the receipt
' hash, one SaveChangesAsync (AuditChain seals the row), then GradingQueue.Enqueue per coding answer and hub "SessionFinalized").
' Open arrowhead (->>) = asynchronous message with no reply (queue hand-off, SignalR push); the two pushes
' leave the diagram at its right edge because GradingQueue and MonitoringHub get no lifeline (space).
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}

actor Student
participant "Exam\nWindow" as EW
participant "ExamSession\nViewModel" as VM
participant "ApiClient" as API
participant "Exams\nController" as EC

Student -> EW : Submit and confirm\n(or timer ends)
activate EW
EW -> VM : submit
activate VM
VM -> VM : send unsent\nsaves first
break a save is still offline
  VM --> EW : Offline
  EW --> Student : "Waiting for network";\nwindow stays open
end
VM -> API : submit exam
activate API
API -> EC : POST submit
activate EC
EC -> EC : desktop app?\nown session?\nin progress?
@enduml
